Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.52,0:00:29.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You look good.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You all free today?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.33,0:00:33.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.66,0:00:35.41,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai's school has lapel pins?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.41,0:00:37.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,When can I message you?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.91,0:00:40.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'll lose it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.28,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I have a conference at 1:00.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.28,0:00:44.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Before noon works.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.19,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'll bring my phone! Be in touch!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.04,0:00:50.15,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,My school allows phones.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.20,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Don't copy my strongman.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.16,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,This is cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.16,0:00:58.38,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai-kyun, your skirt's short.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.58,0:01:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your birthday.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.45,0:01:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy something you like.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and tell me about Daddy!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.58,0:01:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still hanging onto that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He abandoned us. Do you really want to see him?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.71,0:01:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He abandoned {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.53,0:01:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to put it that way?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.13,0:01:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Rika, you won't understand this yet, but—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You stink like alcohol!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.29,0:03:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Leon will eat anything, even when he's small.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.23,0:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem carnivorous, though.{so which is it?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is omnivorous too—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.07,0:03:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.40,0:03:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to celebrate.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.78,0:03:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be Ai's not-a-shut-in party, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.99,0:03:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about sudden. What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.08,0:03:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized beating myself up \Nat home wouldn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.50,0:03:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Beating yourself"? Whoa, kinky.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.70,0:03:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But was it all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you bullied?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.18,0:03:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was fine, although I have no idea why.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.16,0:03:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone seemed cautious \Nwith me, maybe because I was out.{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.78,0:03:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You call that "fine"?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.36,0:04:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm alone at school, I have three friends outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.65,0:04:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.19,0:04:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.53,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens, tell us.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.49,0:04:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If worse comes to worst, feed them to Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're essentially Haters.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.66,0:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.70,0:04:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.50,0:04:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends really are great, huh, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us if you have problems too, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.50,0:04:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you listen to me grumble all day!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.76,0:04:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Grumble?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.85,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My flush of daddies.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.03,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got sugar daddies?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.73,0:04:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.82,0:04:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these five is my real daddy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.15,0:04:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, which one is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.03,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this one's eyebrows look like mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.28,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That said{then again?}, even I don't know the answer.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.87,0:05:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm not even sure he's one of these guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise with this woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.00,0:05:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got into middle school, I could meet my daddy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.71,0:05:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She promised, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.72,0:05:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I don't know either.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.31,0:05:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm preeetty sure it's one of these guys, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make that face.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.57,0:05:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my genuine daughter. I gave birth to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about that!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That part pisses me off the most.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.19,0:05:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman can't stand the idea of me \Nmeeting Daddy and getting along with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.27,0:05:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.82,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll never allow me to be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.68,0:06:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she's a tragic heroine with a persecution complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.82,0:06:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.48,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't insult your mom so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Aren't you on my side?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am. That's why I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.79,0:06:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to trash talk my mother either.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.21,0:06:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's nothing like your moms.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She throws a fit when things don't go her way,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and all she tells me are half-assed lies.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.03,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She's never told me she's sorry for anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.19,0:06:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing she does have is her damn pride.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.65,0:06:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She "should have been happier," \Neven though it's her own fault.{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.28,0:06:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, she hates me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.03,0:07:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Like she could have been happy if only she hadn't had me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.95,0:07:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she has her reasons, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate her as well?{what}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.92,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.57,0:07:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what they call "codependence"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't make a clean break, nothing will—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to lecture me, goody-two-shoes!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.35,0:07:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I've had it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.40,0:07:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd chase after me, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.19,0:07:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you wanted me to.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll join you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.65,0:08:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing what?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Insulting our moms.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.18,0:08:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't force it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.11,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got complaints, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.53,0:08:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.65,0:08:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the Single-Mother Girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some name.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.32,0:08:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.66,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.66,0:08:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Serious Rika right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What was all that about, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.59,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered all the bad things at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.60,0:08:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It made it harder.{wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.85,0:08:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I hate my mom, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.44,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been wondering if I'll end up like her someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.44,0:08:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.32,0:08:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, adults seem like a different species!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.54,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, don't they get married and bang because they {\i1}like {\i0}it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.42,0:09:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because we're kids?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.15,0:09:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,don't get it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Rika, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.49,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She seems fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.19,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm sure she'll be back \Nto her usual self tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.99,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm not cut out for female society.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.74,0:09:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help saying what I think.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.46,0:09:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What I think is logical and correct.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.07,0:09:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fine that way, Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.61,0:10:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it when everyone just pretends to agree.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.22,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it's like to worry about parents.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.19,0:10:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You get along with yours, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had either.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.94,0:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.27,0:10:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as if that spared me a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.03,0:10:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The smallest one of all those lights is probably our bar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.44,0:10:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How often do you see your daddy, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.82,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... About once a month.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.57,0:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom doesn't take your daddy away.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.97,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still your daddy, even if your parents broke up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.24,0:10:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I fantasize about mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.61,0:10:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more because I can't see him.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"A beautiful woman never needs a wallet."
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,His gentle voice is all I remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.11,0:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't... remember his face.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.03,0:11:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll meet him someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.82,0:11:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.82,0:11:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him {\i1}now{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.79,0:11:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Moping over!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.78,0:11:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.28,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Handle the Haters!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is today's assignment.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.99,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll be saved, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.79,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You know Ikeda Clinic?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.79,0:12:03.75,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The old guy there is awful at giving shots.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.34,0:12:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rika. Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.51,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,No way. That's awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.51,0:12:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.63,0:12:07.63,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What? It's her birthday?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.63,0:12:08.76,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Today's the day.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.55,0:12:11.72,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Wow. How old is she?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat your cake.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.78,0:12:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.55,0:12:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.66,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My little turtle, Mannen.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.94,0:13:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.61,0:13:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.24,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{Come}Go back.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.66,0:13:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your worries will go away.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.70,0:13:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.71,0:13:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The teacher! He'll connect us to the cosmic truth!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrust everything to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do so, and you will be saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.00,0:13:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shove it, you old creep!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.31,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake! All bark and no bite.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.61,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?! You attacked the teacher!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.90,0:13:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Teacher?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.16,0:13:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of love, the universe, and the spiritual!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.07,0:13:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.41,0:13:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom was in poor health, and Dad was struggling at work.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.58,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We were cursed by karma from our past lives!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.50,0:14:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we abandoned our attachments to the physical world!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We got rid of our house and money
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.38,0:14:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so our whole family could connect to the cosmos!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got swindled and then killed yourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.31,0:14:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You suffer too, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.43,0:14:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down, we're all the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.44,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All fixated on worthless appearances and hierarchies.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.36,0:14:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}haves{\i0} grow arrogant; the {\i1}have-nots{\i0} grow envious.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of new-age lecture?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.37,0:14:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you don't cut yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Erase yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.08,0:14:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That will make it easier.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.59,0:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be easier?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.21,0:14:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.63,0:14:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Acca, how is Rika doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on your own battles.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.10,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm worried. She was crying.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be in a fix.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.19,0:15:06.15,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.81,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's happening!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.90,0:15:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,gave up on fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.24,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All those held in my arms are linked \Nto the mysteries of the cosmos.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.79,0:15:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still tense.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.46,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It doesn't hurt, does it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.88,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.76,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tiny self can become part of a vast energy.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.89,0:15:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My tiny self...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.89,0:15:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll become one with the teacher.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.06,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to envy or hate anyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.02,0:15:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll erase your karma
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.65,0:15:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and connect.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.78,0:15:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.28,0:16:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that would be nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.45,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.83,0:16:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.00,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just me. We're all here.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.71,0:16:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.42,0:16:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to let it end in a place like this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is "like me"?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.10,0:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.26,0:16:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, don't be fooled!{TODO order and stuff}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.10,0:16:23.97,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.02,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,Rika, say something!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, hang on!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.02,0:16:26.85,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worn out.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.77,0:16:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and surrender yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.53,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.36,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saved that way, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.83,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to be saved, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.12,0:16:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we lose one?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.09,0:16:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.92,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the hug of life!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.69,0:17:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.66,0:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that turtle doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.03,0:17:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen, you're supposed to deal with the Haters.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.58,0:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He imprinted on me,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,so he thinks I'm his mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.67,0:17:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've got to... protect your mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.52,Default - Momo,,0,0,0,,Rika, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.52,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Rika, come back!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.52,0:17:49.64,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,We're all here!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.64,0:17:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.64,0:17:50.68,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.56,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.90,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost turned into a selfish, piece-of-shit mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.94,0:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom taught me one true thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.49,0:18:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Men who ask women for money
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.87,0:18:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,are all fakes!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.04,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's real!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.50,0:18:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The teacher is real!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He channels the cosmos!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.71,0:18:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe what you want!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.85,0:18:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,if he channels it
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.14,0:18:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,or scrambles it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.24,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock you off your feet with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.76,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.27,0:19:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.15,0:19:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're weak, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.65,0:19:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} weak.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.74,0:19:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I use this to balance so \NI don't have to ditch things I care about.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.66,0:19:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm weak,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.37,0:19:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's the real me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it means hurting myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.13,0:19:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.38,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.72,0:19:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.76,0:19:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real "hug of life."
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.98,0:19:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.85,0:19:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.48,0:20:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,don't die.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.66,0:20:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.08,0:20:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! What should we do today?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.45,0:20:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.17,0:20:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I got hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's cake in the fridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.85,0:20:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the cream's all dried out, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.93,0:20:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It really was the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.61,0:20:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I got old before I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.40,0:20:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only 40.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.99,0:20:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.16,0:20:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It {\i1}is{\i0} dried out.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.25,0:21:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure... you'll abandon me, too, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.34,0:21:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.34,0:21:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.31,0:21:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.44,0:22:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
